          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahejeje kubabwira ivyo, aca aduzwa mw’ijuru bamuraba, haza igicu kiramupfuka, ntibaba bakimubona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakirangamije mu kirere baraba ingene aduga, haboneka abagabo babiri bambaye amakanzu zera, bahagarara i ruhande yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barababaza bati: “Yemwe bagabo b’i Galilaya, ni kuki muhagaze ngaha muraba mw’ijuru? Uwu Yesu akuwe muri mwebwe akajanwa mw’ijuru, azogaruka uko nyene mumubonye agenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko baca bava kuri uwo Musozi wa Elayono, basubira i Yerusalemu, ni nk’urugendo rwemewe ku musi w’Isabato",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ikilometero 1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitse, baca baja mu cumba co hejuru, ico bari bamazemwo imisi, na bo ni aba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bose bakoranira hamwe bahuje umutima n’inama mu masengesho, bari kumwe na Mariya nyina wa Yesu n’abandi bagore, hamwe na bene nyina ba Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri iyo misi, Petero ahagarara hagati y’abo bene Data (bashika nk’ijana na mirongo ibiri), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arababwira ati: “Bene Data, Ivyanditswe vyategerezwa gushika kuri Yuda, umwe yaza arongoye abaje gufata Yesu. Ivyo Mpwemu Yera yari yarabivuze kera aciye kuri Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda yari umwe muri twebwe, kandi twari dusangiye igikorwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ingero Yuda yahawe kubera ikibi yakoze yaguzwemwo itongo kandi ni ryo yaguyemwo, akoroka atanguje umutwe, inda yiwe irasaba, amara arasanzara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababa i Yerusalemu bose baramenye iyo nkuru, baca bita iryo tongo Akelodama, bisobanurwa ngo: Itongo ry’amaraso.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero avuga ati: “Mu gitabu ca Zaburi handitswe ngo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko baca batanga amazina y’abantu babiri ngo batoremwo umwe. Umwe yari Yosefu bita Barusaba (akongera akitwa Yusito), uwundi yari Matiyasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko barasenga, bavuga bati: “Ewe Mwami Imana, ni wewe uzi imitima y’aba bantu bose. None rero niwerekane uwo utoranije muri aba babiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo abandanye iki gikorwa c’intumwa, ico Yuda yataye akaja ukwiwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bagira ubupfindo, Matiyasi aba ari we atorwa, aca yongerwa kuri bamwe cumi n’umwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
